  degenerate=False: max |P_E F^xx P_E - V Pi|_E| over 13 k (q=1e-6) = 1.67e-06
  degenerate=True: max |P_E F^xx P_E - V Pi|_E| over 13 k (q=1e-6) = 1.67e-06

=== (9) size of the RB failure at a = l_P for an axis-mover optical photon (|c| = 1/a, RECALLED l_P, lambda) ===
  k a = 2.031e-28; axis-mover strain response / physical redshift = 1/(k a) = 4.924e+27 (sign = sign of v.c: blueshift for movers against their label)
